From a27929a14c1bb557231e61490421fbe4f11111d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 17:34:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: casts wait out the global cooldown; fights report
 cast-failure reasons (F-219)

The Tirisfal mage's session: 2743 CMSG_CAST_SPELL, 1930 SMSG_CAST_FAILED. The 400 ms hold was
cleared on SPELL_GO, so the next tick cast into the 1.5 s GCD. Now GO holds until 1.5 s after the
cast was sent and a failure waits 300 ms; KillResult.cast_fails lists "spell:result xN" per fight
(shown in the fight log) so the remaining reasons are measured, not guessed.
Needs a module rebuild - queued for the next full fleet restart.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
---
 zeppelin/modules/combat/api/combat.pb.go | 14 ++++++++++++--
 zeppelin/modules/combat/combat.proto     |  1 +
 zeppelin/modules/combat/main.go          | 17 ++++++++++++++---
 zeppelin/tests/start_area.py             |  3 ++-
 4 files changed, 29 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

